+---
+id: task-001-implement-rfc-6901-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement the library's first JSON-document navigation primitive.
+
+Acceptance criteria:
+
+- `src/index.ts` exports `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`.
+- It follows RFC 6901 token syntax and decoding (`~0` for `~`, `~1` for `/`), including the empty
+  pointer referring to the complete document.
+- It resolves object-member and array-element references and returns the referenced JSON value.
+- It throws for malformed pointer syntax and for references that cannot be resolved, including
+  invalid array indices.
+- Focused automated tests cover normal resolution, escaping, root resolution, and failure cases.
